---
import PolicyLayout from "../layouts/PolicyLayout.astro";

export const prerender = true;
---

<PolicyLayout heading="Terms and Conditions" path="/terms-and-conditions" description="Terms for using the Global Business Excellence Awards website, submitting materials and arranging awards-related bookings or services.">
  <p>These terms explain how you may use the Global Business Excellence Awards website and how website information relates to nominations, enquiries and awards-related services. Please read any separate programme or booking conditions before making a commitment or payment.</p>

  <section>
    <h2 class="gold-text">About the organiser</h2>
    <p>Global Business Excellence Awards is organised by London Business Consultancy, based in London, UK. Our UK headquarters address is 20 Wenlock Road, London, N1 7GU, United Kingdom. Questions about these terms can be sent to <a href="mailto:info@gbeaward.com">info@gbeaward.com</a>.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="gold-text">Using this website</h2>
    <p>You may browse the website and use its information for lawful personal or business purposes. You must not attempt to gain unauthorised access, interfere with the website, introduce malicious software, impersonate another person or use our forms and contact channels for fraud, harassment or unsolicited bulk messages.</p>
    <p>Website information is provided to explain the awards and related activities. It is not legal, financial or other regulated professional advice, and visiting the website or sending an enquiry does not create a consultancy engagement.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="gold-text">Programme information and submissions</h2>
    <p>The eligibility requirements, categories, submission arrangements, deadlines and any selection conditions for a particular programme are those published or communicated for that programme. A past winner's profile does not establish eligibility or an award outcome for another applicant or year.</p>
    <p>Information you submit must be accurate to the best of your knowledge. You must have permission to submit another person's details or an organisation's materials. An enquiry, nomination or application is not by itself a confirmed event booking, paid-service agreement or award decision.</p>
    <p>Only provide photographs, logos, text and other materials you are entitled to share. If you supply material specifically for publication, you authorise its use for that stated purpose, subject to any agreed restrictions and applicable privacy and intellectual-property rights. Tell us promptly if submitted information needs correction.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="gold-text">Bookings, services and payments</h2>
    <p>Where a fee applies, the service, price, currency, payment arrangements and relevant booking conditions should be set out before you pay. Check the quotation, invoice, order details or booking confirmation and ask us to clarify anything that is unclear.</p>
    <p>Specific terms agreed for a booking or service govern that transaction alongside applicable law. These website terms do not replace a separately agreed contract or retrospectively change an existing booking. Cancellation, payment-error and refund enquiries are covered by our <a href="/refund-policy">Refund Policy</a>.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="gold-text">Website content and brand materials</h2>
    <p>Website text, design, photographs, artwork and brand materials are protected by intellectual-property rights belonging to us or the relevant rights holders. You may link to public pages and make reasonable personal or internal-business use of their information. Reproducing substantial content, using another party's images or presenting our branding as your own requires the appropriate permission.</p>
    <p>An award, partner logo or recognition reference must not be presented as an endorsement beyond the scope of the recognition actually given. Please contact us if you need guidance on using an award title or GBE Awards materials.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="gold-text">Availability, corrections and external links</h2>
    <p>We take reasonable care over website information, but details may need updating and the website may occasionally be unavailable. Contact us about a material error or accessibility problem. Any change affecting an existing booking remains subject to the agreed booking terms and applicable law.</p>
    <p>Links to external websites, social platforms, application services or payment providers lead to services with their own terms and privacy practices. A link does not give us control over another provider's content or service.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="gold-text">Privacy and your legal rights</h2>
    <p>Our <a href="/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a> explains how information is handled when you use this website or contact the awards team.</p>
    <p>Nothing in these terms excludes or limits liability, consumer protections or other rights that cannot lawfully be excluded or limited. Mandatory rights applicable to your circumstances take precedence over any inconsistent wording on this website.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="gold-text">Questions and changes to these terms</h2>
    <p>Email <a href="mailto:info@gbeaward.com">info@gbeaward.com</a> or use our <a href="/contact">contact page</a> with a question, correction or complaint. Include the relevant page, programme or booking reference so we can understand the issue.</p>
    <p>Updates will be published on this page with a revised date. Changes apply to future website use and do not remove rights or alter transaction terms already agreed with you.</p>
  </section>
</PolicyLayout>
